      "fields": {
        "heading": {
          "zh": "產品介紹",
          "en": "Products"
        },
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "憶活素 MemoProve",
              "en": "MemoProve"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "是由奧地利 EVER PHARMA 自家研究和開發的專利配方（蛋白腖 Peptone）。它能幫助修復及收復大腦中的細胞，顯著增強認知表現、記憶力及專注力。",
              "en": "is a patented formula (Peptone) researched and developed in-house by EVER PHARMA of Austria. It helps repair and restore cells in the brain, significantly improving cognitive performance, memory and concentration."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "市面上許多腦部保健品缺乏臨床數據，甚至產地模糊不清。康草堂引進的憶活素採用高品質成分，於歐洲經過嚴格測試，確保安全有效，是您守護大腦健康的首選。",
              "en": "Many brain supplements lack clinical data. MemoProve uses high-quality ingredients, rigorously tested in Europe for safety and efficacy."
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text-block",
      "wrap": {
        "tag": "div",
        "section": "product-details-card",
        "id": "detailedInfo",
        "container": false
      },
