              "zh": "中老年人群，希望維持腦部年輕狀態",
              "en": "Middle-aged and older people wishing to keep the brain youthful"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "工作壓力大、腦疲勞者",
              "en": "People under work pressure or with mental fatigue"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "保健養生、提升認知功能人士",
