        "heading": {
          "zh": "科研實證",
          "en": "Scientific Evidence"
        },
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "奧地利 EVER PHARMA 與多家歐洲研究機構合作，通過雙盲、安慰劑對照臨床試驗證實：連續服用憶活素 12 週後，受試者的記憶力評分提升 35%，專注力測試成績提高 42%，且無任何不良反應。",
              "en": "EVER PHARMA of Austria, working with a number of European research institutes, has confirmed through double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trials that after 12 weeks of continuous use of MemoProve, participants' memory scores rose by 35% and their concentration test results by 42%, with no adverse reactions."
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group"
      }
    },
